      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement envelope encryption using a managed key service, I will use the AWS Key Management Service (KMS) as the external provider. This choice is based on its widespread use and robust security features. The code will include the 'boto3' library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, to interact with AWS KMS. The 'boto3' library and the use of AWS KMS will make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
